{"id":"b99a1c06a5e1bcf7","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-thm-extendible-hierarchy.md","title":"Extendible Hierarchy","display":"thm-extendible-hierarchy — Extendible Hierarchy","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-extendible-hierarchy","aliases":["58-thm-extendible-hierarchy"],"display":"thm-extendible-hierarchy — Extendible Hierarchy","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-extendible.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[58-df-elementary-embedding]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-extendible-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-extendible-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-extendible-hierarchy — Extendible Hierarchy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"955facc376d59b85\" href=\"?note=955facc376d59b85\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-extendible.md\">../batch02/58-df-extendible.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" href=\"?note=a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" title=\"58-df-elementary-embedding\">58-df-elementary-embedding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu,j\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu,j\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Extendible}\">\\(\\mathrm{Extendible}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\\)</span> are the predicates from the dependencies</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V_\\xi\">\\(\\mathcal V_\\xi\\)</span> is the set-coded structure with universe <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\xi\">\\(V_\\xi\\)</span> and membership relation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\in\\cap V_\\xi^2\">\\(\\in\\cap V_\\xi^2\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{crit}(j)=\\min\\{\\alpha:\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land j(\\alpha)\\neq\\alpha\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{crit}(j)=\\min\\{\\alpha:\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land j(\\alpha)\\neq\\alpha\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}extendible\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Extendible}(\\kappa)\n\\to\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\;\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa&lt;\\lambda\n\\to\n\\exists\\mu\\;\\exists j\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,\\mathcal V_\\lambda,\\mathcal V_\\mu)\n\\land\\operatorname{crit}(j)=\\kappa\n\\land\\lambda&lt;j(\\kappa)\n\\right]\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}extendible\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Extendible}(\\kappa)\n\\to\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\;\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa&lt;\\lambda\n\\to\n\\exists\\mu\\;\\exists j\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,\\mathcal V_\\lambda,\\mathcal V_\\mu)\n\\land\\operatorname{crit}(j)=\\kappa\n\\land\\lambda&lt;j(\\kappa)\n\\right]\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Extendibility uses elementary embeddings between the set-coded rank structures <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V_\\lambda\">\\(\\mathcal V_\\lambda\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V_\\mu\">\\(\\mathcal V_\\mu\\)</span>; the former untyped arrow <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j:V_\\lambda\\preccurlyeq V_\\mu\">\\(j:V_\\lambda\\preccurlyeq V_\\mu\\)</span> has been removed.</li>\n<li>Extendible cardinals imply the existence of many large cardinals.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-extendible.md","status":"resolved","id":"955facc376d59b85","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-extendible.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-elementary-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"a25c0a66cf56c0f4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-elementary-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu,j\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Extendible}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V_\\xi","display":false},{"tex":"V_\\xi","display":false},{"tex":"\\in\\cap V_\\xi^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{crit}(j)=\\min\\{\\alpha:\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land j(\\alpha)\\neq\\alpha\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}extendible\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Extendible}(\\kappa)\n\\to\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\;\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa<\\lambda\n\\to\n\\exists\\mu\\;\\exists j\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,\\mathcal V_\\lambda,\\mathcal V_\\mu)\n\\land\\operatorname{crit}(j)=\\kappa\n\\land\\lambda<j(\\kappa)\n\\right]\n\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal V_\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V_\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"j:V_\\lambda\\preccurlyeq V_\\mu","display":false}],"bytes":1523,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4138","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-thm-extendible-hierarchy.md|58-thm-extendible-hierarchy]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["955facc376d59b85","5fb1c2241d1943d1","a25c0a66cf56c0f4","5582a281f15a33c2"]}